<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Automatic Scooter Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>Monthly rental is where automatic scooters in Hanoi become genuinely cheap, with verified monthly rates running from 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND for the entry machines up to a 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND band for the Honda Vision. This guide plans a month on an automatic around those published figures: which machines sit in which monthly tier, what a month costs per day, where the monthly rate beats stacking weeks, and what to confirm before a long booking.</p>
<p>We work through the verified monthly rates tier by tier, the per-day arithmetic that makes a month so much cheaper than daily riding, the break-even against weekly bookings, and the questions that protect a long stay from surprises. Every verified rate in the city sits in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, the full model range is in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a> collects the questions renters raise most.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">the verified monthly rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">what a month on an automatic buys</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">the per-day arithmetic of a month</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">monthly against weekly stacking</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">choosing the machine for a month</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">planning a monthly budget</a></li>
